%% Semantic environments: theorem/proof/definition/... (titled, ruled, nestable).
%%   lmr2svg examples/environments/deck.lmr -o environments.html
!title Semantic environments
!madewith

!slide Theorem and proof

!theorem Fixed point on a tree ^bp-fix
	On a tree, sum-product converges to the exact marginals in a finite number
	of steps.

	!remark
		A dedent ends the innermost environment; environments nest.

!proof
	A leaf-to-root then root-to-leaf sweep stabilises every message.

!slide More kinds

!definition Convexity
	A set is convex if it contains every segment between its points.

!warning
	`!theorem`, `!lemma`, `!definition`, `!proof`, `!example`, `!remark`,
	`!warning`, `!exercise`, and more are built in; a theme restyles each kind.
